{
    "title": "ABC7 Bay Area",
    "description": "Stream live newscasts with the ABC7 Bay Area app.  Stay up-to-date on local news and weather, along with national top stories.  Plus, customize the app based on your interests. \r\n\r\nWATCH\r\n- All of ABC7's live streams are available in one place\r\n- Looking for videos that aired in a newscast or entire newscasts you might have missed? Find those under the \"videos\" tab\r\n- Use the \u201cpicture in picture\u201d feature to watch live video while you use other apps on your phone\r\n\r\nEXPLORE\r\n- Want good news?  Or stories where you live? Search for your stories of interest using the explore section\r\n- Browse content in our featured sections like Building a Better Bay Area, I-Team Investigations, Allies in Action, and more!\r\n\r\nWEATHER\r\n- Easily choose your locations to get hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts where you live\r\n- See real-time LiveDoppler7 maps along with detailed weather information\r\n- Get weather and traffic alerts to prepare you for severe conditions\r\n\r\nMY NEWS\r\n- Stay informed on stories that matter to you by choosing topics you care about\r\n- The My News section builds a unique feed just for you based on interests and the locations you choose\r\n- Choose customized alerts for topics and locations you care about.... breaking news, weather and traffic alerts, sports, and all things Bay Area!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Stream live newscasts with the ABC7 Bay Area app.  Stay up-to-date on local news and weather, along with national top stories.  Plus, customize the app based on your interests. <br><br>WATCH<br>- All of ABC7&#39;s live streams are available in one place<br>- Looking for videos that aired in a newscast or entire newscasts you might have missed? Find those under the &quot;videos&quot; tab<br>- Use the \u201cpicture in picture\u201d feature to watch live video while you use other apps on your phone<br><br>EXPLORE<br>- Want good news?  Or stories where you live? Search for your stories of interest using the explore section<br>- Browse content in our featured sections like Building a Better Bay Area, I-Team Investigations, Allies in Action, and more!<br><br>WEATHER<br>- Easily choose your locations to get hourly conditions and 7-day forecasts where you live<br>- See real-time LiveDoppler7 maps along with detailed weather information<br>- Get weather and traffic alerts to prepare you for severe conditions<br><br>MY NEWS<br>- Stay informed on stories that matter to you by choosing topics you care about<br>- The My News section builds a unique feed just for you based on interests and the locations you choose<br>- Choose customized alerts for topics and locations you care about.... breaking news, weather and traffic alerts, sports, and all things Bay Area!",
    "summary": "Stream live ABC7 news, plus get customized breaking news and weather alerts!",
